er.As this is the first Preview of our multiplayer system, you may encounter bugs or rough edges while playing. Your feedback will help us improve and expand co-op as development continues.And co-op isn't the only thing that'","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T13:00:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929549","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149640-1839041357036621","game_id":"steam-4149640","kind":"update","title":"On the Rocks Demo v1.01 Update Patch Notes","summary":"Hi everyone, first of all thank you for playing our demo and for your feedbacks. The patch is live now. See the list below for details; Localization: 1.Fixed some languages conflicts after changing language. 2.Fixed some Japanese words not appearing. 3.Fixed a bug makes language unchangeable or semi-changed. Controls and UI 1.Gamepad run/sprint issue was fixed. 2.Additional fixes were made on gamepad input switching and UI bridge. 3.Many layout/flow fixes were made on Inventory UI, Pocket Watch,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T19:55:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357036621","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149640-1838407329269059","game_id":"steam-4149640","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO NOW AVAILABLE! - Play On the Rocks right now!","summary":"Wasteland barkeepers, the wait is over! The playable demo for On the Rocks is officially LIVE and FREE on Steam right now! Watch YouTube Video What’s Waiting for You in the Demo? This demo focuses directly on our core gameplay loop: scavenge resources, craft radioactive drinks, serve wasteland survivors, and defend your bar from mutant waves.Bar Management: Step behind the bar, take orders, and run the show.Scavenge & Craft: Brave the dangerous desert for raw materials and use industrial machine","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-21T14:00:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329269059","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4149640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:26Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:26Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4149640":"2026-10-26T11:43:26Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4149640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:26Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:26Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:26Z"},"4686830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:26Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:26Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:26Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4149640","app_id":4149640,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:28Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"ed40eeafead10b7a02fae87cab7ada5f71fc4e41b18e7e98be569cab55428800","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Run a bar in a toxic wasteland, solo or in co-op with up to 4 players. Scavenge the wasteland, brew with what you find, and serve whoever comes through your doors. In a world gone to ruin, the last bar standing is yours to run together.","publishers":[{"name":"312 Interactive","creator_clan_account_id":45837851}],"developers":[{"name":"LootBAG Studios","creator_clan_account_id":46089854}]},"release":{"steam_release_dat